'''Vampire's Edge''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Vampire Item Pack]] for 1,699 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading, as the event has since ended.  

== Appearance ==
The knife is black with red and silver strokes on it. There are 6 sharp objects on the blade that resemble claws.

== Trivia ==
* It has four [[Unique Weapons|unique]] counterparts that were released as trophies for finishing on the Top 100 leaderboard during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]], those being the [[Blue Vampire's Edge]], [[Bronze Vampire's Edge]], [[Silver Vampire's Edge]], and [[Gold Vampire's Edge]].
*It is part of the Full Vampire's Set with [[Vampire's Axe]] and [[Vampire's Gun]].
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]].
*Unlike most weapons, it is not salvageable in the crafting station.
*It partners with its own effect under the name [[Vampire]].

